-> ABOUT [node:49ba726c-031e-4a01-839f-11a76a8bf009] @ 2026-09-08T13:42:10.938906+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:ccc18558-7181-44df-9608-de587d8d937c] @ 2026-09-08T09:38:01.635211+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:e12ca220-5f82-4226-a2eb-9964701f03c4] @ 2026-09-08T09:38:01.635211+00:00

The original cat-of-the-day idea is split into two separate card types rather than one: comic-of-the-day pulls an external image from RSS and therefore carries attribution, keyword filtering and copyright exposure, while ascii-art-of-the-day is generated by the AI with its own prompt, model and size and carries none of that. Different parameters and different legal questions mean merging them into one type would be wrong.
---
