-> HAS_FACET [node:c62c070b-e4a6-41b3-86f3-00ad5d96800f] @ 2026-09-09T11:56:14.706976+00:00

src/server/index.ts is a side-effecting bootstrap script (opens the DB, runs migrations, calls app.listen at module top level) with no exported buildApp/createServer factory, so there is no Fastify route-level test harness (no app.inject usage anywhere in test/). Existing tests only exercise pure modules — repositories directly (test/persistence.test.ts) and fetch/parse logic with an injected fetcher (test/freshness.test.ts, mirroring src/server/upstream/open-meteo.ts's fetchWithTimeout pattern). The established convention for testable non-trivial logic here is: extract it into its own pure module under src/server/<area>/, test that module directly, and keep the route handler in index.ts a thin, untested pass-through — not to refactor index.ts into an exported app factory, since Faza 4/5 sibling branches also edit this file and a restructure would create avoidable merge conflicts.
---
