-> DEPENDS_ON [node:8d6eee18-8766-45cd-b78b-9840aa0b2029] @ 2026-09-09T11:58:47.465608+00:00

Compacting persists as two additive columns on `conversations` — `summary` (text, nullable) and `summarizedThroughMessageId` (references messages.id, set null on delete) — rather than deleting or mutating the summarized `messages` rows. History stays intact for the UI to display in full; ConversationService's context-builder reads the summary plus everything after `summarizedThroughMessageId` instead of the full row set once compacting has run. This keeps the AiCall recorded for a compaction's messageId null exactly as [node:8d6eee18] describes — no single Message to point at.
---
