needs_review: false
retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> DEPENDS_ON [node:279d73e0-ff0f-4184-a25c-f051d2030072] @ 2026-09-09T12:01:45.117809+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:68b03a85-d372-45c5-80a4-549ebf826798] @ 2026-09-09T12:01:45.117809+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:ccc18558-7181-44df-9608-de587d8d937c] @ 2026-09-09T12:01:45.117809+00:00
-> ABOUT [node:f29aa338-eddb-456b-97ad-00b602cb9a42] @ 2026-09-09T12:01:45.117809+00:00

The Kilo Gateway is byte-for-byte OpenAI-compatible: POST /api/gateway/chat/completions with stream:true and stream_options.include_usage:true returns SSE frames shaped {"choices":[{"delta":{"content":"..."}}]}, an ": KILO PROCESSING" comment/keepalive line that must be skipped rather than JSON-parsed, a final chunk carrying usage.{prompt_tokens,completion_tokens}, then a literal "data: [DONE]". GET /api/gateway/models needs no auth and returns pricing.{prompt,completion} as decimal-string USD-per-token, or "-1" for auto-router entries with no fixed price (mapped to null; cost math for those falls back to 0 rather than throwing). Verified live against the real gateway during planning (2026-09-09), including a real free-tier chat completion end to end.
---
