-> ABOUT [node:8b9566f6-a1d5-4c43-952e-369c2796d5ca] @ 2026-09-10T04:35:56.030713+00:00
-> DEPENDS_ON [node:8d6eee18-8766-45cd-b78b-9840aa0b2029] @ 2026-09-10T04:35:56.030713+00:00

k7-chat-voice-input's transcription cost logging fallback: AiCall.record for purpose:'transcription' always logs promptTokens: 0, completionTokens: 0, estimatedCostUsd: 0, because the assumed OpenAI-Whisper-style transcription response carries no usage object at all (unlike chat completions, which always report prompt_tokens/completion_tokens). This is a deliberate degrade-to-zero rather than inventing a token estimate from audio duration or file size — matching ascii-art.ts's existing precedent of tolerating a best-effort-only cost calculation rather than failing the primary action over bookkeeping.
---
