k7-chat-voice-input's transcription model is selected via a DEFAULT_TRANSCRIPTION_MODEL constant in kilo.ts (thinkingmachines/inkling-small:free, one of three free audio-input-capable models found live — [node:ee4cadd2]), overridable by a K7_KILO_TRANSCRIPTION_MODEL env var, mirroring the existing K7_KILO_GATEWAY_URL override pattern. This is the deliberate escape hatch for the unverified /audio/transcriptions contract [node:2704bad5]: an operator can repoint the model without a code change if the free-tier default turns out unsuitable or the endpoint expects a different kind of model entirely.
