Carousel and grid nesting needs no export/circular-import workaround: createWidget(card) in main.ts stays a single non-exported recursive function. For carousel/grid, it builds the container custom element, then calls itself on each nested slide/cell card and appends the result as a light-DOM child, which the container's shadow-DOM <slot> projects. No .svelte file ever imports createWidget.
