path: /artifact/hidden-is-a-ua-stylesheet-rule-displa
created_at: 2026-09-10T04:39:18.567870+00:00
needs_review: false
retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> HAS_FACET [node:a1174884-8d33-4260-af5b-0f97264a2ea2] @ 2026-09-10T04:39:18.567870+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:e12ca220-5f82-4226-a2eb-9964701f03c4] @ 2026-09-10T04:39:18.567870+00:00

[hidden] is a UA-stylesheet rule (display:none) that loses to any author style setting display on the same element, including a custom element's own shadow-root :host{display:...} rule. Only K7Card.svelte currently sets :host{display:block} among existing widgets, so native hidden happens to work on today's two menu targets (k7-audiometer, k7-timer) by accident of them having no :host display rule. Added a defensive `.page [hidden] { display: none !important; }` rule to app.css so menu-driven hiding stays correct regardless of which widget a future menu targets, including the new container components which do set :host{display:block}.
---
