wakeOnPresence (camera-based motion/face-detection wake from the slideshow) is deliberately deferred out of k7-container-widgets: idleTriggerSeconds, intervalSeconds, transition and exitOnInteraction are implemented fully; wakeOnPresence params are parsed and stored but never acted on. This is a materially separate feature (webcam access, local motion/face-detection processing) that deserves its own decision moment. Note: [node:9ea20285] (CAMERALOCAL) already records presence-wake-via-camera as a settled lifetime decision for *when* it is built, not a maybe - this change does not implement it and does not contradict that decision, it simply isn't built yet.
