-> HAS_FACET [node:a1174884-8d33-4260-af5b-0f97264a2ea2] @ 2026-09-10T04:56:23.991020+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:e12ca220-5f82-4226-a2eb-9964701f03c4] @ 2026-09-10T04:56:23.991020+00:00

k7-container-widgets was verified in a real browser (headless Chromium via playwright-core against the actual google-chrome binary, used transiently then reverted from package.json — not a project dependency), not just via unit tests and static checks. Confirmed against layout.yaml's real karuzela/grid-wskazniki/menu-kuchnia usage: carousel next-button click correctly advances both slides' translate3d() (0%/100% before, -100%/0% after — the outgoing slide exits left, the incoming one lands at 0%); menu-kuchnia's defaultActive correctly shows audiometr and hides minutnik-kuchnia on initial mount (the dispatch-on-mount effect works), and clicking the second menu item correctly flips both — audiometrHidden:true, minutnikHidden:false — confirming the full k7-menu-change event -> main.ts listener -> document.getElementById -> hidden attribute -> [hidden]!important CSS pipeline works end to end. No JS console errors during any of this; the only failed network requests were an ascii-art gateway call (no real Kilo Gateway key in the sandbox) and one benign 404, both unrelated to the four new card types.
