-> HAS_FACET [node:c62c070b-e4a6-41b3-86f3-00ad5d96800f] @ 2026-09-10T05:55:20.392678+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:e12ca220-5f82-4226-a2eb-9964701f03c4] @ 2026-09-10T05:55:20.392678+00:00

Every user-facing change must add a dated entry to changelog.yaml in the same change that makes it. The dashboard's own changelog popup (header button, "DZIENNIK ZMIAN") reads changelog.yaml via GET /api/changelog — an entry added in a later change than the one it describes is one the household never saw attached to what actually changed. Decided 2026-09-10, also recorded in CLAUDE.md's standing constraints.
---
